      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people want to help but they don't actually know me. the version of me they knew is gone and the version that's left just... doesn't matter. it's like i'm already dead to the world, just a shadow. staying here feels so pointless when there's nothing left to hold onto. it's just a hollow shell.",
